{0 LSP Features}

{ul
  {- all docs with prefix "feature-" is considered an active feature.}
  {- an active feature should be tested against its spec. }
  {- deprecated or superseded features are named differently}
  {- a spec listed under {!specified} is written but not implemented: it is a
     feature-level spec awaiting code, not a feature the server has.}
}

