{1:specified Specified, not yet implemented}

Written against the same standard as the active ones, and each states its own
testing obligations. Moving one up to {b Active} means the code and its tests
exist and reference the spec.

{ul
  {- {!page-"feature-completion-markdown-links"} — completion inside
     [\[label\](…)], where only [\[\[…\]\]] is served today.}
  {- {!page-"feature-codeaction-create-missing-heading"} — the fragment case
     {!page-"feature-codeaction-create-unresolved-link"} excludes.}
  {- {!page-"feature-aliases"} — frontmatter [aliases] as alternative names for
     a note, in resolution and completion. Mostly core work.}
  {- {!page-"feature-footnotes"} — completion, navigation, references, rename,
     and diagnostics for footnote labels, document-scoped.}
  {- {!page-"feature-completion-callouts"} — callout types, at any nesting
     depth, from built-ins, vault CSS, and vault usage.}
}
